    "description": {
      "zh": "复用 MACE-MP-0b3 基线，加固定 PBE-D3(BJ) 两体色散。仅纯硅周期 CPU 单点/固定 FIRE；分项报告，不含 ATM 或长程静电。组合配置，不是新训练模型。",
      "en": "Shared MACE-MP-0b3 baseline plus fixed two-body PBE-D3(BJ). Pure-Si periodic CPU single points/fixed FIRE with component reports; no ATM/electrostatics. Composition profile, not a new trained model."
    },
    "examples": [
      {
        "zh": "对 si-diamond 使用 MACE+D3(BJ) 探索单点，分开报告基线、色散修正和总能量/力/应力，并显示3D。",
        "en": "Run MACE+D3(BJ) on si-diamond; separate baseline, correction and total energy/forces/stress, with 3D."
      },
      {
        "zh": "对扰动纯硅周期结构进行 MACE+D3 固定晶胞 FIRE，100步、fmax 0.05 eV/Å；输出真实收敛及分项报告，不加第二个D3。",
        "en": "Relax perturbed pure Si using fixed-cell MACE+D3 FIRE, 100 steps at 0.05 eV/Å; show actual convergence and components without adding a second D3."
      }
    ],
    "limitations": [
      {
        "zh": "最多128原子，晶胞最小奇异值≥4 Å、体积/原子≥5 Å³、周期最小原子间距≥2.3 Å；仅探索。截断10/5 Å、未含ATM；不代表完整无限长程或DFT精度。",
        "en": "At most 128 atoms; minimum cell singular value >=4 Å, volume/atom >=5 Å³, periodic distance >=2.3 Å. Exploratory; cutoffs 10/5 Å, no ATM. Not infinite-range or validated DFT accuracy."
      },
      {
        "zh": "仅审核固定未附加色散的MACE基线；拒绝任意基线、重复色散、变胞、MD、长程静电、电场、自旋及Δ-learning。",
        "en": "Only the fixed baseline without added dispersion is reviewed; arbitrary baselines, duplicate dispersion, variable cell, MD, electrostatics, fields, spin and delta learning are blocked."
      }
    ],
